      "description": "Simulation study of a quantum circuit for pricing a discrete floating-strike Asian option on a binomial valuation tree, evaluated path-by-path and then in superposition for n=5 time steps, with varying gearbox approximation levels and Fourier-series truncation.",
      "algorithm": {
        "family": "amplitude-estimation",
